<title>UK: Bad weather closes Skikda port again.</title>
<headline>Bad weather closes Skikda port again.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Skikda port was closed for tanker loadings again on Tuesday because of bad weather, shipping sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;It closed this morning,&quot; the official said, adding that he was expecting more bad weather in the evening. He did not know when the port would reopen.</p>
<p>Skikda was closed for much of last week because of bad weather but had reopened by Monday.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
